871-### 5. Agent updates task-board but doesn't finish work
872-
873-**Symptom:** `task-board agents` shows agent as active with recent updates, but agent actually exited. Tasks are stuck in `analysis`, `development`, `testing`, or `reviewing` with no real blocker.
874-
875-**Cause:** Agent ran the first lifecycle commands, then exited before completing the actual work or reaching its role handoff status. Board state looks active even though execution stopped.
